<title>POLAND: ZASADA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.22 vs   0.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.96 vs   1.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.32 vs   1.29</p>
<p> Sales		   45.37 vs  33.57</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.34 vs   1.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.16 vs   2.69</p>
<p> Sales		   66.17 vs  56.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
